WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:15.580 --> 00:00:21.520
our substitute bill would restore the teeth&nbsp;
in the senate-passed bill that were extracted&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:21.520 --> 00:00:25.540
by the education and Labor Committee and&nbsp;
it would add some important and necessary&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:25.540 --> 00:00:31.360
for vision to deal directly with abuses which&nbsp;
were left untouched by the committee bill our&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:31.360 --> 00:00:34.990
bill would be generally in line with the&nbsp;
recommendations made by Senator McCullen&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:34.990 --> 00:00:40.930
and with the proposals made by the president&nbsp;
in our opinion the substitute would restore&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:40.930 --> 00:00:45.250
the Senate passed version of the McClellan&nbsp;
Bill of Rights and put back in the criminal&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:45.250 --> 00:00:49.480
penalties that were taken out by the&nbsp;
the house committee it would strike out&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:49.480 --> 00:00:56.890
an exemption which would exempt 70% of the&nbsp;
unions in the country from reporting under&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:56.890 --> 00:01:02.620
